)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-one-probe\" rel=\"nofollow\">The One Probe (by McJty)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/atum\" rel=\"nofollow\">Atum 2: Return to the Sands (by Shadowclaimer)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dungeons-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dungeons Mod (by dainxt)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/malisisdoors\" rel=\"nofollow\">MalisisDoors (by Ordinastie)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mixin-0-7-0-8-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mixin 0.7-0.8 Compatibility (by NotStirred)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chisels &amp; Bits (by AlgorithmX2)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chococraft-3\" rel=\"nofollow\">ChocoCraft 3 (by TheSlayer5934)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/malisiscore\" rel=\"nofollow\">MalisisCore (by Ordinastie)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/broken-wings\" rel=\"nofollow\">Broken Wings (by quat1024)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unloader\" rel=\"nofollow\">Unloader (by Unnoen)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\">GeckoLib (by ThanosGecko)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether-addon\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aether Continuation (by XaeronTheProtogen)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/secretroomsmod\" rel=\"nofollow\">SecretRoomsMod (by AbrarSyed)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/worleys-caves\" rel=\"nofollow\">Worley's Caves (by super_fluke)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/featured-servers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Featured Servers (by Jake_Evans)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fastfurnace\" rel=\"nofollow\">FastFurnace (by Shadows_of_Fire)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tinkers-complement\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tinkers' Complement (by KnightMiner)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty (by Forstride)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-beautiful-plates\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Beautiful Plates (by Kreezxil)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisel\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chisel (by tterrag1098)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cqrepoured\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chocolate Quest Repoured (by Lordepos)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/foamfix-optimization-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">FoamFix (by asiekierka)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventory-tweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inventory Tweaks [1.12 only] (by JimeoWan)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tree-chopper\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tree Chopper (by MrDuchy)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tinkers-construct\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tinkers Construct (by mDiyo)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/malisisswitches\" rel=\"nofollow\">MalisisSwitches (by Ordinastie)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dimensionaldoors\" rel=\"nofollow\">DimensionalDoors (by DimensionalDevelopment)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dungeon-tactics\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dungeon Tactics (by PegBeard)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patchouli (by Vazkii)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mantle\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mantle (by mDiyo)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchanting-plus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enchanting Plus (by DarkhaxDev)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/performant\" rel=\"nofollow\">Performant (by someaddon)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rough-mobs-revamped\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rough Mobs Revamped (by p1ut0nium_94)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/journeymap\" rel=\"nofollow\">JourneyMap (by techbrew)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/soul-shards-respawn\" rel=\"nofollow\">Soul Shards Respawn (by TehNut)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/smooth-font\" rel=\"nofollow\">Smooth Font (by bre2el)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/angry-pixel-the-betweenlands-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">[ANGRY PIXEL] The Betweenlands (by MrCompost)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/constructs-armory\" rel=\"nofollow\">Construct's Armory (by TheIllusiveC4)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gottschcore\" rel=\"nofollow\">GottschCore (by gottsch)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/surge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Surge (by DarkhaxDev)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/natura\" rel=\"nofollow\">Natura (by mDiyo)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hexxit-gear\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hexxit Gear (by Shadows_of_Fire)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/recurrent-complex\" rel=\"nofollow\">Recurrent Complex (by Ivorforce)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ivtoolkit\" rel=\"nofollow\">IvToolkit (by Ivorforce)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-shields\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spartan Shields (by ObliviousSpartan)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/netherportalfix\" rel=\"nofollow\">NetherPortalFix (by BlayTheNinth)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stimmedcow-nomorerecipeconflict\" rel=\"nofollow\">stimmedcow : NoMoreRecipeConflict (by Forge_User_08823382)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/atomicstrykers-infernal-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">AtomicStryker's Infernal Mobs (by atomicstrykergrumpy)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/atomicstrykers-battle-towers\" rel=\"nofollow\">AtomicStryker's Battle Towers (by atomicstrykergrumpy)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/attributefix\" rel=\"nofollow\">AttributeFix (by DarkhaxDev)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether (by GildedGames)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark (by Vazkii)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/born-in-a-barn\" rel=\"nofollow\">Born in a Barn (by Speiger)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-erebus\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Erebus (by vadis365)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughids\" rel=\"nofollow\">NotEnoughIDs (by fewizz_)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Twilight Forest (by Benimatic)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-advancements\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Advancements (by way2muchnoise)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abyssalcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">AbyssalCraft (by Shinoow)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tomb-many-graves-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tomb Many Graves 2 (by M4thG33k)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iron-chests\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron Chests (by ProgWML6)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/autoreglib\" rel=\"nofollow\">AutoRegLib (by Vazkii)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abyssalcraft-integration\" rel=\"nofollow\">AbyssalCraft Integration (by Shinoow)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wearable-backpacks\" rel=\"nofollow\">copygirl's Wearable Backpacks (by HeckinChloe)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterfps\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterFps (by Guichaguri)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waddles\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waddles (by Girafi)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fastworkbench\" rel=\"nofollow\">FastWorkbench (by Shadows_of_Fire)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/phosphor-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Phosphor (Forge) (by jellysquid3)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advent-of-ascension-nevermine\" rel=\"nofollow\">Advent of Ascension (Nevermine) (by Scimiguy)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/placebo\" rel=\"nofollow\">Placebo (by Shadows_of_Fire)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanillafix\" rel=\"nofollow\">VanillaFix (by Runemoro)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong>系统要求</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>Hexxit Updated 是一个相当轻量的整合包，包含约 90 个模组。最低内存分配要求为 2.5GB。通过调整部分 JVM 参数，你或许能在较老的电脑上运行 Hexxit Updated。我成功在分配 2.5GB 内存的情况下运行最新版本，游戏时内存占用率大约在 80%-90%（渲染距离为 8，帧率约 60fps）。</p>\n<p><br>此外还有 OptiFine。OptiFine 不允许直接添加到整合包中，但你可以自行添加。非常推荐安装，因为它能大幅提升 FPS，并增加几乎必不可少的缩放功能。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>最低系统要求：<br>操作系统：64位<br>内存：4GB<br><br>我的电脑配置：<br>CPU：Intel Pentium G4560<br>GPU：Nvidia GTX 1050Ti<br>RAM：G.Skill 1x8GB</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Logo链接：&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.novaskin.me%252fskin%252f5407075021094912%252fOriginal-Diamond-Sword\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://minecraft.novaskin.me/skin/5407075021094912/Original-Diamond-Sword</a></p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>",
